title: "Active Inference Implementations"
abstract: >-
  Educational notebooks implementing and exploring probabilistic inference and
  active inference methods, including RxInfer.jl tutorials on Bayesian
  inference on factor graphs by message passing. Maintained by the Active
  Inference Institute.
